# The Debian source packages docker/sway.Dockerfile rebuilds for trixie. Each is
# pinned by its .dsc on snapshot.debian.org, whose URLs never change; the .dsc
# pins its tarballs by SHA-256, which dpkg-source checks when it unpacks them.
#
# wlroots stays on 0.19, the newest series trixie's libraries can build: 0.20
# needs libdrm >= 2.4.129 and wayland-protocols >= 1.47, where trixie has 2.4.124
# and 1.44. Sway 1.11 is the release built against wlroots 0.19.
WLROOTS_DSC_URL=https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20260326T203750Z/pool/main/w/wlroots/wlroots_0.19.3-1.dsc
WLROOTS_DSC_SHA256=9b680831bcc1c8f5766b3f244610180f9000749d16dbafd103699c2fa968accf
SWAY_DSC_URL=https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20251005T203402Z/pool/main/s/sway/sway_1.11-3.dsc
SWAY_DSC_SHA256=cc2ebf5652bae4b68aded7aec5b38dc1c7addb4487c010ff3ea1ea07b23c3d2e
